  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights for Young Women and Adolescent Girls- DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sexual and Reproductive Rights and Health program aims to increase the enjoyment of sexual and reproductive rights. It targets young women and adolescent girls living in vulnerable conditions by improving the quality of interventions related to sexual and reproductive health, water, hygiene and sanitation, as well as gender and advocacy.  It is being implemented in the province of Equateur, in 4 health zones. It will cover the period from April 2021 to May 2028.</narrative>
  </description>
